WEBVTT

00:00:21.595 --> 00:00:22.806
Now listen, yo!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:23.907
People put your guns up

00:00:23.931 --> 00:00:25.575
First 'I run dat

00:00:25.599 --> 00:00:28.245
Run around and shoot them

00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:30.814
Brand new sound, yes still survival

00:00:30.838 --> 00:00:33.183
Here comes the sound boy, live in this world

00:00:33.207 --> 00:00:35.785
Intelligence, strength, and luck are swirling, flow

00:00:35.809 --> 00:00:38.722
My swelled mind is candid

00:00:38.746 --> 00:00:39.756
One punch to Banner in Savannah

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.057
An easy knockout, bam bam bam

00:00:41.081 --> 00:00:42.993
One time for your mind, live through this

00:00:43.017 --> 00:00:44.227
Around the world

00:00:44.251 --> 00:00:46.730
It haunts me, the pain of the past

00:00:46.754 --> 00:00:49.533
Around the noble god are borrowed things

00:00:49.557 --> 00:00:52.235
When the seed that's sown flowers, whose is it

00:00:52.259 --> 00:00:55.171
Live and fire the arrow of faith, more more more

00:00:55.195 --> 00:00:57.707
There is no peace where you're going

00:00:57.731 --> 00:01:00.310
Come on, stand up, don't give up the fight

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:05.415
Now, yes, this instant, die die die

00:01:05.439 --> 00:01:08.084
Big shooter, living fast, blazing

00:01:08.108 --> 00:01:10.687
Beat you up, cut it open, break

00:01:10.711 --> 00:01:13.323
Shot shooter, he lived fast, crazy

00:01:13.347 --> 00:01:16.026
Adjust your sights at point-blank range, break

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:18.728
Big shooter, living fast, blazing

00:01:18.752 --> 00:01:21.331
Beat you up, cut it open, break

00:01:21.355 --> 00:01:23.967
Shot shooter, he lived fast, crazy

00:01:23.991 --> 00:01:26.892
Adjust your sights at point-blank range, break

00:01:51.185 --> 00:01:55.122
"It's the Beginning of a Brand New Day"

00:01:59.627 --> 00:02:06.876
If AC equals one, then BC equals the
square root of three, and AB equals two.

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:12.349
Also, BA equals DB, and BD equals two.

00:02:12.373 --> 00:02:19.155
And since triangle BAD is an isosceles
triangle, its base angles are equal.

00:02:19.179 --> 00:02:22.592
So BDA equals BAD.

00:02:22.616 --> 00:02:29.566
Therefore, BDA equals one hundred eighty
degrees minus ABD divided by two,

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:31.935
which equals one hundred eighty degrees...

00:02:31.959 --> 00:02:33.770
--Ma'am!
--Yes?

00:02:33.794 --> 00:02:35.956
Kurono's got a hard-on!

00:02:37.197 --> 00:02:39.309
Kurono, you're such a horndog!

00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:41.811
Is that all you can think about?

00:02:41.835 --> 00:02:44.827
Shut up! What are you...?

00:02:46.106 --> 00:02:47.550
I do not!

00:02:47.574 --> 00:02:50.720
Then try standing up!

00:02:50.744 --> 00:02:53.089
Settle down! We're in the middle of class!

00:02:53.113 --> 00:02:54.357
Kurono...

00:02:54.381 --> 00:02:55.959
Yes?

00:02:55.983 --> 00:02:59.942
Save that for when you get home, will you?

00:03:03.524 --> 00:03:07.392
Go sleep somewhere else, you lazy bum!

00:03:07.728 --> 00:03:08.695
"Oku no Matsu"

00:03:11.532 --> 00:03:13.309
"Books"

00:03:13.333 --> 00:03:14.177
"Books"
Oh, man, you have got to be kidding me.

00:03:14.201 --> 00:03:17.313
Oh, man, you have got to be kidding me.

00:03:17.337 --> 00:03:19.635
Hey, you, wait!

00:03:21.642 --> 00:03:25.789
Damn! That's the third time this
has happened! That bastard!

00:03:25.813 --> 00:03:26.322
"Furuta Books" Damn! That's the third
time this has happened! That bastard!

00:03:26.346 --> 00:03:28.091
"Furuta Books"
Honey, keep an eye on the store for me!

00:03:28.115 --> 00:03:30.226
"Furuta Books"
Come back, you!

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:31.661
"Furuta Books"
The third time?

00:03:31.685 --> 00:03:31.895
The third time?

00:03:31.919 --> 00:03:33.396
Your attention, please.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.032
--Aw, man, how much longer is it gonna keep on raining?
--We are currently experiencing major delays

00:03:36.056 --> 00:03:39.069
--Twenty-three hundred yen? What a rip!
--due to the heavy precipitation.

00:03:39.093 --> 00:03:43.473
--Damn! His office is gonna close at five!
--We deeply apologize for the inconvenience. Thank you for your patience.

00:03:43.497 --> 00:03:46.242
I know he's just gonna lock
himself up in there and hide.

00:03:46.266 --> 00:03:50.280
What am I going to do? At this rate,
my husband will get home before me.

00:03:50.304 --> 00:03:54.350
C'mon! You've got to be kidding me!
Tonight, I'm supposed to score.

00:03:54.374 --> 00:03:58.555
Like, bummer! If I don't hurry,
Ryosuke'll go home!

00:03:58.579 --> 00:04:00.980
That means we won't be able
to have sex today, either!

00:04:02.316 --> 00:04:07.097
Sorry to bother you, young man.
May I ask you something?

00:04:07.121 --> 00:04:10.700
Is this the right platform for Hinodedai?

00:04:10.724 --> 00:04:13.336
Aw, man! Couldn't you ask someone else?

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:16.840
I don't think this is it, but it's
too much of a pain to explain.

00:04:16.864 --> 00:04:19.075
Yeah, this is it.

00:04:19.099 --> 00:04:21.845
I see. Thank you very much.

00:04:21.869 --> 00:04:25.815
Oh, jeez, not a wino. Go get a job.

00:04:25.839 --> 00:04:27.951
Ewww, gross!

00:04:27.975 --> 00:04:30.987
I'd better make sure I'm not
stuck in the same car as him.

00:04:31.011 --> 00:04:36.726
Stupid bum, boozing in the
middle of the day. Ain't that rich?

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:41.210
Jeez, man, you reek! I'll shove you
onto the tracks if you're not careful!

00:04:42.589 --> 00:04:45.769
What da hell you looking' at?

00:04:45.793 --> 00:04:48.404
I wasn't put here for yer amusement!

00:04:48.428 --> 00:04:52.609
Excuse me. This seems
to be the wrong platform.

00:04:52.633 --> 00:04:57.180
Hey, old lady, you should
try figuring it out yourself,

00:04:57.204 --> 00:04:59.883
instead of relying on others to do it for you.

00:04:59.907 --> 00:05:02.103
I'm sorry.

00:05:03.143 --> 00:05:07.223
I may not look the type, but |
actually have a low opinion of others.

00:05:07.247 --> 00:05:09.092
That guy and lady over there...

00:05:09.116 --> 00:05:12.428
Even if they live a long time, they can't
be thinking about anything deep.

00:05:12.452 --> 00:05:14.597
And these kids? They're even worse.

00:05:14.621 --> 00:05:18.101
They're a bunch of airheads. I just know it.

00:05:18.125 --> 00:05:22.238
I'd better stay away from someone like him.

00:05:22.262 --> 00:05:24.526
I'm not even gonna consider him.

00:05:28.302 --> 00:05:30.964
Hey, Kato! You slowpoke!

00:05:32.406 --> 00:05:34.238
Kei!

00:05:35.876 --> 00:05:38.988
Kei, wait for me!

00:05:39.012 --> 00:05:42.158
It's him! Masaru Kato!

00:05:42.182 --> 00:05:43.660
I'm pretty sure of it.

00:05:43.684 --> 00:05:46.696
He vaguely looks like the kid
I knew from elementary school.

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:48.965
<i>I heard he's turned into quite a
punk since he switched schools.</i>

00:05:48.989 --> 00:05:51.201
I bet he doesn't even remember me.

00:05:51.225 --> 00:05:54.671
We used to play together a lot.
I probably played with him the most.

00:05:54.695 --> 00:05:58.359
But now look at him. He looks like a thug.

00:06:00.801 --> 00:06:03.379
--Hey, are you all right?
--A man's fallen onto the tracks.

00:06:03.403 --> 00:06:04.948
--Oh, that hurts...
--What happened to him?

00:06:04.972 --> 00:06:07.183
He was staggering and fell.

00:06:07.207 --> 00:06:09.369
C'mon, get up!

00:06:11.578 --> 00:06:16.426
Uh-oh, he's in for it now. it's because he's drunk.

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:21.331
The station attendant's not coming,
and no one's gonna go down and help him.

00:06:21.355 --> 00:06:23.566
The platform's wet because of
the rain, and he must've slipped.

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:25.335
Somebody hurry up and
call the station attendant!

00:06:25.359 --> 00:06:27.470
Oh, no, I wish someone would help him.

00:06:27.494 --> 00:06:29.038
He's a lost cause.

00:06:29.062 --> 00:06:31.708
Wow, I've never seen someone
fall on the tracks before!

00:06:31.732 --> 00:06:33.810
I'm gonna e-mail Ryosuke and tell him about it!

00:06:33.834 --> 00:06:35.845
Owww...

00:06:35.869 --> 00:06:38.581
Helping him would be the
humane thing to do, but...

00:06:38.605 --> 00:06:42.619
<i>I'm sure someone else will do it.
I've got my mortgage to pay back.</i>

00:06:42.643 --> 00:06:43.786
If...

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:44.787
...no one helps him...

00:06:44.811 --> 00:06:45.688
<i>we'll...</i>

00:06:45.712 --> 00:06:47.690
...probably get to see a human body...

00:06:47.714 --> 00:06:49.692
...get torn apart.

00:06:49.716 --> 00:06:54.916
Qutside of the movies, I've never
seen a man get torn apart before.

00:06:56.790 --> 00:07:00.136
I guess even a punk like him
gets scared to see people die.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:04.563
Come to think of it, even back then,
he was such a chicken.

00:07:05.732 --> 00:07:08.044
All right, that does it!

00:07:08.068 --> 00:07:10.280
What the...?

00:07:10.304 --> 00:07:13.082
You've gotta be out of your mind!

00:07:13.106 --> 00:07:15.218
Trying to act cool, huh? What an idiot!

00:07:15.242 --> 00:07:18.421
What do you think you can do on your own?

00:07:18.445 --> 00:07:19.689
A kid's on the tracks.

00:07:19.713 --> 00:07:21.691
What the hell is he doing? He's gonna die!

00:07:21.715 --> 00:07:24.193
Oh, gosh! both of them
could get ripped to shreds!

00:07:24.217 --> 00:07:27.881
That boy who went to save him is kind of cute.

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:31.868
Come on, man! Get up!

00:07:31.892 --> 00:07:34.404
Somebody! Come down
here and give me a hand!

00:07:34.428 --> 00:07:38.007
Where the hell is the station attendant?!
Didn't somebody get him?

00:07:38.031 --> 00:07:41.077
Somebody ran to get him.
He should be here any second.

00:07:41.101 --> 00:07:44.080
Come on, people! Are you just
gonna watch us get killed?

00:07:44.104 --> 00:07:47.183
Gimme a break, he's just a bum!

00:07:47.207 --> 00:07:50.053
Who the hell's gonna help you, stupid?!

00:07:50.077 --> 00:07:54.605
Hey, come on, you're the one who's crazy here.

00:07:56.616 --> 00:07:57.894
Kei?

00:07:57.918 --> 00:08:01.664
Hey, come on now! You expect me to go?

00:08:01.688 --> 00:08:04.067
Kei, it's you, right?

00:08:04.091 --> 00:08:09.272
Hey, no fair! Wait a minute!
What are you all staring at me for?

00:08:09.296 --> 00:08:10.440
One of you go!

00:08:10.464 --> 00:08:12.575
What are you waiting for? Get going!

00:08:12.599 --> 00:08:15.211
Go on, he's your friend!

00:08:15.235 --> 00:08:17.246
Hurry up!

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:23.319
Jeez, why am I down here?
What am I doing this for?

00:08:23.343 --> 00:08:26.677
Am I happy he remembered me?

00:08:27.681 --> 00:08:28.992
Get down.

00:08:29.016 --> 00:08:31.127
I said, get down!

00:08:31.151 --> 00:08:33.830
Good, looks like I don't have to go down there.

00:08:33.854 --> 00:08:37.051
You've just signed your death sentences, kids.

00:08:38.425 --> 00:08:40.670
He reeks!

00:08:40.694 --> 00:08:42.772
--This is not good!
--Hurry!

00:08:42.796 --> 00:08:44.440
Where the hell's the station attendant?

00:08:44.464 --> 00:08:46.943
The next train is arriving
at platform two shortly.

00:08:46.967 --> 00:08:49.178
Please step behind the white line.

00:08:49.202 --> 00:08:51.381
Come on, stand up!

00:08:51.405 --> 00:08:53.216
I know, I know!

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.151
I feel so sick I can't muster up the strength.

00:08:55.175 --> 00:08:57.754
What are you doing? Hurry up!

00:08:57.778 --> 00:08:59.155
Pull him up, Kato!

00:08:59.179 --> 00:09:01.876
That's what I'm doing, so stand up! Now!

00:09:03.917 --> 00:09:06.996
Oh, shit! The train's coming!

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.432
I'm gonna puke...

00:09:09.456 --> 00:09:12.790
Come on, you two! Climb up! Now!

00:09:14.861 --> 00:09:17.273
Hey, run!

00:09:17.297 --> 00:09:18.674
We're done for!

00:09:18.698 --> 00:09:19.909
How's running gonna help?

00:09:19.933 --> 00:09:22.011
Trains slow down as they reach the station!

00:09:22.035 --> 00:09:24.947
Just run beyond the point
where the first car stops!

00:09:24.971 --> 00:09:26.916
Oh, yeah! I didn't think of that!

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:29.819
--Good luck!
--We still have a chance! We'll be okay!

00:09:29.843 --> 00:09:32.388
Kato! Lose the bag!

00:09:32.412 --> 00:09:33.723
Drop your belongings!

00:09:33.747 --> 00:09:36.759
I have to take this umbrella with me!

00:09:36.783 --> 00:09:38.928
What?! This isn't the time
to be worrying about that!

00:09:38.952 --> 00:09:41.964
It's my kid brother. He doesn't
have an umbrella at school!

00:09:41.988 --> 00:09:44.801
I have to bring this to him!

00:09:44.825 --> 00:09:48.304
Well, anyway, lose the bag! We're gonna die!

00:09:48.328 --> 00:09:49.672
All right, already!

00:09:49.696 --> 00:09:52.875
The express train bound for
Hinodedai will be passing shortly.

00:09:52.899 --> 00:09:56.358
For your safety, please stay
behind the white line.

00:09:57.537 --> 00:10:00.283
Express?! Only local trains...

00:10:00.307 --> 00:10:02.752
...stop at this station!

00:10:02.776 --> 00:10:08.257
Oh jeez, I can't believe it! The last
thing I bought was a girlie mag!

00:10:08.281 --> 00:10:11.260
I'll make sure you get your umbrella, Ayumu!

00:10:11.284 --> 00:10:13.362
Kei, are you all right?

00:10:13.386 --> 00:10:15.398
Hell, no!

00:10:15.422 --> 00:10:16.799
I'm gonna die!

00:10:16.823 --> 00:10:19.368
I'm scared?! I'm scared to die?

00:10:19.392 --> 00:10:22.338
An opening! Look for an opening!
There's gotta be one!

00:10:22.362 --> 00:10:24.490
I don't see one, man!

00:10:26.266 --> 00:10:29.827
No way! I know, {'ll take a picture!

00:10:35.208 --> 00:10:37.199
They're not gonna make it!

00:10:39.079 --> 00:10:41.791
What's going on?

00:10:41.815 --> 00:10:43.426
Kato...

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:46.062
What is that?!

00:10:46.086 --> 00:10:47.997
Gross!

00:10:48.021 --> 00:10:50.718
That's what you get for helping a bum!

00:10:55.195 --> 00:10:58.529
Oh, come on! Quit taking pictures!

00:10:59.533 --> 00:11:01.477
What the hell are you looking at?

00:11:01.501 --> 00:11:03.946
This isn't a show!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:07.668
Just shut up already!
There's nothing to scream about!

00:11:09.009 --> 00:11:12.741
Well, if this is the way it's gotta be...

00:11:31.097 --> 00:11:33.156
Here are some more.

00:11:39.439 --> 00:11:41.284
Did you see that?! Their heads flew off!

00:11:41.308 --> 00:11:42.785
--Their heads?!
--No way!

00:11:42.809 --> 00:11:44.120
Get outta here!

00:11:44.144 --> 00:11:50.743
Hey, you! Those two high school boys
are dead! They died to save you!

00:11:53.353 --> 00:11:55.598
Aw, man! What a mess!

00:11:55.622 --> 00:11:58.134
Did you two almost die, too?

00:11:58.158 --> 00:12:01.617
What the hell is going on here?

00:12:04.598 --> 00:12:08.244
I don't know how, but... look! We made it!

00:12:08.268 --> 00:12:10.680
What do you mean, look?!

00:12:10.704 --> 00:12:12.148
You didn't make it.

00:12:12.172 --> 00:12:13.983
Just shut up.

00:12:14.007 --> 00:12:18.387
This is Heaven. We're all dead.

00:12:18.411 --> 00:12:22.725
Speak for yourself, geezer!

00:12:22.749 --> 00:12:25.661
Well, that's one possible theory.

00:12:25.685 --> 00:12:29.365
Until only a moment ago, I was in
the hospital, fighting with cancer.

00:12:29.389 --> 00:12:34.237
Now it doesn't even hurt anymore.
How do you explain that?

00:12:34.261 --> 00:12:36.639
Dead? That can't be.

00:12:36.663 --> 00:12:39.442
My heart's beating! And I'm breathing, too!

00:12:39.466 --> 00:12:42.378
Hey, wait.

00:12:42.402 --> 00:12:44.213
Wait a sec! Look!

00:12:44.237 --> 00:12:46.449
That's Tokyo Tower!

00:12:46.473 --> 00:12:49.552
Tokyo? We're in Tokyo?!

00:12:49.576 --> 00:12:50.987
I can't touch it!

00:12:51.011 --> 00:12:53.309
What do you mean, you can't touch it?

00:12:58.451 --> 00:13:00.763
No way! What's going on?!

00:13:00.787 --> 00:13:04.433
It won't open, or rather,
we can't even touch the wall.

00:13:04.457 --> 00:13:09.238
If we could leave this room,
we wouldn't be sitting here like this.

00:13:09.262 --> 00:13:11.240
Even our cell phones don't work.

00:13:11.264 --> 00:13:12.475
You've gotta be kidding!

00:13:12.499 --> 00:13:15.945
What about making noise?
So the neighbors can hear us?

00:13:15.969 --> 00:13:18.063
There was no response.

00:13:19.339 --> 00:13:21.584
The front door's no good, either!

00:13:21.608 --> 00:13:24.453
Where are they? I don't see anything.

00:13:24.477 --> 00:13:26.489
Well, over there somewhere.

00:13:26.513 --> 00:13:28.424
There isn't even any blood.

00:13:28.448 --> 00:13:31.060
But their heads flew clean off, right?

00:13:31.084 --> 00:13:36.399
I even took pictures of their heads
flying off, but they don't show up.

00:13:36.423 --> 00:13:40.002
But both their bags are here.

00:13:40.026 --> 00:13:41.270
This is...

00:13:41.294 --> 00:13:43.539
Everyone, may I have your attention?

00:13:43.563 --> 00:13:46.375
Let's all introduce ourselves.

00:13:46.399 --> 00:13:50.379
Start with your name and
occupation, and how you died.

00:13:50.403 --> 00:13:52.982
Stuff it! You sound like a teacher or something.

00:13:53.006 --> 00:13:55.498
That's because I am a teacher.

00:13:59.045 --> 00:14:04.026
I'm Masashi Yamada. I teach first grade
at Nerima Higashi Elementary.

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:07.930
I was riding my scooter
when I got into an accident.

00:14:07.954 --> 00:14:10.933
Okay, let's start with you.

00:14:10.957 --> 00:14:14.136
Why me?

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:17.907
Kei Kurono, tenth grader. I died...

00:14:17.931 --> 00:14:20.943
Even though I don't think I'm actually dead!

00:14:20.967 --> 00:14:22.712
...because of him.

00:14:22.736 --> 00:14:25.448
That's right. It's all his fault.

00:14:25.472 --> 00:14:28.417
Yeah, you're right, Kei. I'm sorry.

00:14:28.441 --> 00:14:30.920
I thought you helped me
because you wanted to.

00:14:30.944 --> 00:14:33.055
Who would want to?

00:14:33.079 --> 00:14:36.459
Your introduction...

00:14:36.483 --> 00:14:38.761
Masaru Kato, a train ran me over.

00:14:38.785 --> 00:14:40.963
A train ran you over, my ass.

00:14:40.987 --> 00:14:46.235
Are you even sorry for what you did?
You really piss me off!

00:14:46.259 --> 00:14:48.637
Hey, I think I know this guy.

00:14:48.661 --> 00:14:50.172
Next, please.

00:14:50.196 --> 00:14:51.707
Goro Suzuki.

00:14:51.731 --> 00:14:54.577
He's a politician or something.
I've seen himon TV.

00:14:54.601 --> 00:14:56.899
You may have heard of me.

00:14:59.239 --> 00:15:00.783
Okay, next.

00:15:00.807 --> 00:15:03.152
| pass. Go on to the next person.

00:15:03.176 --> 00:15:05.855
C'mon, introduce yourself!

00:15:05.879 --> 00:15:08.424
You're making me look like
an idiot for behaving myself!

00:15:08.448 --> 00:15:11.127
Can I bum some smokes off anyone?

00:15:11.151 --> 00:15:13.929
You look like a girl!

00:15:13.953 --> 00:15:17.433
Joichiro Nishi, eighth grader. I fell.

00:15:17.457 --> 00:15:19.535
Oh, this kid's spooky.

00:15:19.559 --> 00:15:22.938
Why is he staring at me? Creepy.

00:15:22.962 --> 00:15:25.775
So, no one's got any cigarettes?

00:15:25.799 --> 00:15:27.543
Okay, next...

00:15:27.567 --> 00:15:32.437
Er, next... please.

00:15:34.073 --> 00:15:39.522
He's a yakuza, and so am I. Enough said.

00:15:39.546 --> 00:15:42.607
Okay, anyone else?

00:15:46.119 --> 00:15:47.985
I guess that's it.

00:15:49.355 --> 00:15:52.401
Hey, Kei, there's something different about you.

00:15:52.425 --> 00:15:53.335
Yeah?

00:15:53.359 --> 00:15:55.304
I could say the same about you.

00:15:55.328 --> 00:15:57.506
You used to be more aggressive.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:16:03.813
Sharp, like you were afraid of
nothing. You were our leader.

00:16:03.837 --> 00:16:05.781
Oh, really?

00:16:05.805 --> 00:16:07.850
When was this?

00:16:07.874 --> 00:16:10.419
Oh, man, this is embarrassing! Cut it out!

00:16:10.443 --> 00:16:12.021
Did something happen?

00:16:12.045 --> 00:16:14.657
You're different, too, you know.

00:16:14.681 --> 00:16:17.426
Remember how we used to play tag all the time?

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.928
Yeah.

00:16:18.952 --> 00:16:21.197
You ran so fast.

00:16:21.221 --> 00:16:23.933
Whether you were running away
or chasing us, you were amazing!

00:16:23.957 --> 00:16:26.202
You'd jump down an entire flight of stairs.

00:16:26.226 --> 00:16:28.170
Enough already!

00:16:28.194 --> 00:16:29.538
There was this one time...

00:16:29.562 --> 00:16:31.240
It was so cool. I don't remember why, but...

00:16:31.264 --> 00:16:35.110
You were being chased by all
the tough kids from school.

00:16:35.134 --> 00:16:39.970
You jumped off the footbridge and actually
landed on the roof of a passing truck.

00:16:41.508 --> 00:16:43.853
I remember thinking then...

00:16:43.877 --> 00:16:47.857
"I want to be like you."

00:16:47.881 --> 00:16:52.328
See, I'm not so smart, so |I go
to the school all the punks go to.

00:16:52.352 --> 00:16:54.697
So I tried to be like you.

00:16:54.721 --> 00:16:57.032
Gimme a break!

00:16:57.056 --> 00:17:01.804
So you're telling me it's my
fault you turned out like this?

00:17:01.828 --> 00:17:05.374
Hey, Kei, what's that?

00:17:05.398 --> 00:17:06.876
What the hell is that?

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:08.444
Here comes another one!

00:17:08.468 --> 00:17:09.445
A girl?

00:17:09.469 --> 00:17:11.164
Maybe.

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:24.426
Did we come here this way, too?

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:26.829
I --Kei?
-Shut up!

00:17:26.853 --> 00:17:30.346
This is not good! Now I've got a hard-on.

00:17:36.029 --> 00:17:38.964
I think I might post these on the net later.

00:17:43.069 --> 00:17:46.549
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

00:17:46.573 --> 00:17:50.753
I don't think you should be doing that.

00:17:50.777 --> 00:17:52.655
No... I just...

00:17:52.679 --> 00:17:55.491
You just what, stupid?!

00:17:55.515 --> 00:17:56.559
Kei!

00:17:56.583 --> 00:18:01.196
Look. There's blood on her wrists,
but there are no cuts.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.899
A bathtub suicide...

00:18:03.923 --> 00:18:06.201
Is she alive?

00:18:06.225 --> 00:18:08.070
I'think she is.

00:18:08.094 --> 00:18:10.039
Hey, you don't have to listen to her heartbeat!

00:18:10.063 --> 00:18:12.207
You could check her pulse at her wrist!

00:18:12.231 --> 00:18:15.578
--You're right.
--Anyway, we should get her off him.

00:18:15.602 --> 00:18:19.232
What? But I didn't... I mean...

00:18:22.208 --> 00:18:24.086
Yoo-hoo!

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:28.591
What? What's going on?

00:18:28.615 --> 00:18:32.245
What's with her? Does she think this is a dream?

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:37.800
All of you stay here!

00:18:37.824 --> 00:18:40.135
Stay here? What are you doing?

00:18:40.159 --> 00:18:42.638
I have a pretty good idea, but...

00:18:42.662 --> 00:18:44.562
You're shitting me.

00:18:50.069 --> 00:18:53.437
He never ceases to amaze me.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:00.008
So you had cigarettes after all.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:04.159
Just because I know I should
doesn't mean I could help her.

00:19:04.183 --> 00:19:05.694
I want to, but...

00:19:05.718 --> 00:19:08.085
<i>Who could possibly do that?</i>

00:19:10.423 --> 00:19:13.135
Oh, yeah, one of them's right here.

00:19:13.159 --> 00:19:15.237
Right!

00:19:15.261 --> 00:19:17.229
Hey, you better not...

00:19:18.665 --> 00:19:21.677
It's hard to find such a
brave young man these days.

00:19:21.701 --> 00:19:23.545
So why don't you help her?

00:19:23.569 --> 00:19:27.631
I have cancer. I couldn't possibly fight a yakuza.

00:19:28.875 --> 00:19:30.185
Stop it!

00:19:30.209 --> 00:19:33.042
What the...? I'll fucking kill you!

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:35.624
Let go!

00:19:35.648 --> 00:19:37.359
--Stop it!
--I'll fucking kill you!

00:19:37.383 --> 00:19:40.114
You fucking idiot!

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:46.785
Stop... please...

00:19:50.263 --> 00:19:52.775
Outta my way!

00:19:52.799 --> 00:19:55.393
Stop it!

00:19:57.403 --> 00:19:59.248
If you stop, I'll let you go!

00:19:59.272 --> 00:20:01.832
If not, I'll just keep you here like this!

00:20:05.344 --> 00:20:07.756
Hey! You're gonna kill him if you keep that up!

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:10.977
Say it! Say, "I won't do this again!”

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:16.865
Say it, I said!

00:20:16.889 --> 00:20:19.483
Man, he's scary.

00:20:20.727 --> 00:20:21.003
What's that?

00:20:21.027 --> 00:20:22.838
It's the beginning of a brand new day
What's that?

00:20:22.862 --> 00:20:25.507
It's the beginning of a brand new day

00:20:25.531 --> 00:20:29.745
A day filled with hope

00:20:29.769 --> 00:20:32.715
Open your heart to happiness

00:20:32.739 --> 00:20:34.116
Open your heart to happiness
Outta my way!

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:34.616
And look up at the big, blue sky
Outta my way!

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:38.420
And look up at the big, blue sky

00:20:38.444 --> 00:20:42.725
Listen to the voice on the radio

00:20:42.749 --> 00:20:47.162
And fill your lungs

00:20:47.186 --> 00:20:51.200
With the fragrant air

00:20:51.224 --> 00:20:51.500
With the fragrant air
What's that?

00:20:51.524 --> 00:20:52.901
<i>One! Two! Three! Let's go!
What's that?</i>

00:20:52.925 --> 00:20:55.622
<i>One! Two! Three! Let's go!</i>

00:20:57.296 --> 00:20:59.041
"Your lives are now over, you bastards.

00:20:59.065 --> 00:21:02.010
"Your lives are now over, you bastards. What
you do with your new lives is for me to decide.

00:21:02.034 --> 00:21:04.526
<i>"Your lives are now over, you bastards. What you do with
your new lives is for me to decide. So there you have it</i>

00:21:06.806 --> 00:21:13.940
We all start out as pure and innocent babes

00:21:18.417 --> 00:21:25.448
Even if you taste the bitter fruit,
don't be discouraged, walk straight

00:21:29.996 --> 00:21:37.996
I know it's in the past, but the rain still stings

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:46.355
I'm lonely as floating ice

00:21:46.379 --> 00:21:51.193
I kiss your thin finger

00:21:51.217 --> 00:21:57.900
And remember you crying

00:21:57.924 --> 00:22:02.771
Even if this is the end

00:22:02.795 --> 00:22:07.676
I won't forget your last kiss

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:15.700
I won't forget... I won't forget...

00:22:19.612 --> 00:22:22.612
I won't forget his kiss
